{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:32:15Z","created_by_operation":"op_e7b220941ad2412b86a036a83ac0abba","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_014efa31d843bbb47a19b2d3b28430df70b01f416a0c7375c783f077740869b0","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"alexgreensh/outsourcerer@0ad71828e118 snapshot bb346553aa25c2f8","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_c5abc9a952fb7b8e0210f522ce27b2a26aa1ba08f64f37776eb01fb75ed445d9"],"source_ids":["src_f489b474fcc85d7d846578b9c12de013"],"text":"The tool is described as a self-contained bash script with no server, proxy, or resident process, shelling out to existing CLIs such as claude, codex, devin, and agy.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:32:15Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e7b220941ad2412b86a036a83ac0abba"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:32:15Z","created_by_operation":"op_e7b220941ad2412b86a036a83ac0abba","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_06f879da88d06b60c7d388e387046f56fe6af506ee18a4faed579a5a6074eb2f","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"alexgreensh/outsourcerer@0ad71828e118 snapshot bb346553aa25c2f8","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_884b74eb73fb52642ffc111c5ee164b45cdcf473140bbfdcb9a5fcb3c097de45"],"source_ids":["src_f489b474fcc85d7d846578b9c12de013"],"text":"Named lanes map to providers: OpenRouter lanes (hy3, glm-5.2, deepseek-*), Codex native (sol/terra/luna), Claude native (fable/opus/sonnet/haiku), keyless Gemini via Antigravity, Hermes, and local ollama:<model>/local lanes.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:32:15Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e7b220941ad2412b86a036a83ac0abba"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:32:15Z","created_by_operation":"op_e7b220941ad2412b86a036a83ac0abba","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_2f02b6e277ce76e7d7282b7833b43336acd884213f0401d0b26b412ee479a181","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"alexgreensh/outsourcerer@0ad71828e118 snapshot bb346553aa25c2f8","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_a9f4c22c9c0add2be117a12b24a11ad78fb5b2709bcdb448be6ead81205598ed"],"source_ids":["src_f489b474fcc85d7d846578b9c12de013"],"text":"For local agentic runs, the harness plumbing is described as certified end to end, but how much workload it can handle depends on the local model's own tool-calling ability.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:32:15Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e7b220941ad2412b86a036a83ac0abba"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:32:15Z","created_by_operation":"op_e7b220941ad2412b86a036a83ac0abba","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_68c1220a2a0a7d6c4d5bdce2eea7edde21e6fd2dfdcf975b6d38b5dfd80918c1","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"alexgreensh/outsourcerer@0ad71828e118 snapshot bb346553aa25c2f8","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_c6ffa549190b94ddacf246e23aa79aafa169f6c8293ba99a80f7f123667a429a","slc_e63019277956650b01c92153b9b103ddbb2754d477629ff00ce33fa9ae74e938"],"source_ids":["src_c2fe5d56968c53a2a86353900bd81dcf","src_f489b474fcc85d7d846578b9c12de013"],"text":"Before any cloud delegation, a hard-block refuses the route if credential files (.env, id_rsa, credentials, etc.) exist anywhere in the working tree; the scan runs on every call and fails closed.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:32:15Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e7b220941ad2412b86a036a83ac0abba"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:32:15Z","created_by_operation":"op_e7b220941ad2412b86a036a83ac0abba","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_831cd3f04849cbaf0aaed82937ff9acb1e7d437acc1c8812074a55b2cdd8a781","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"alexgreensh/outsourcerer@0ad71828e118 snapshot bb346553aa25c2f8","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_4f1af84ec0647c5547dd9dd759031f4aa03cd747c274431b4b5c2ef76232f712","slc_5f92fa8cd74f9c79d1ac2af49a36f30c6ee3421594a735fc5cbaa534432ae91a","slc_91c1ab897de6d85131f61f35e681e53a1275a97406c25bffbb4e000d3f5f7700"],"source_ids":["src_c2fe5d56968c53a2a86353900bd81dcf","src_f489b474fcc85d7d846578b9c12de013"],"text":"Repository development practice: the project is audited with repo-forensics (27 scanners, 500+ patterns) on every release, with every finding triaged by name and no suppressions, per README and SECURITY.md.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:32:15Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e7b220941ad2412b86a036a83ac0abba"}
